<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 1 bln 10-yr bonds on Sept 10.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 1 bln 10-yr bonds on Sept 10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland will offer one billion zlotys of its floating rate 10-year bonds on September 10, the National Bank of Poland said on Monday.</p>
<p>The settlement date for auction is September 18, 1996.</p>
<p>The 10-year bond matures on October 18, 2006.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
